---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Best AI Writing Tools UK 2026" description="Top AI writing assistants for UK content creators, marketers, and small businesses">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 to-blue-600 text-white py-16 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Best AI Writing Tools UK 2026</h1>
      <p class="text-xl opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto">From grammar checking to full content generation, ranked and reviewed</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article class="prose lg:prose-xl mx-auto">
      <p><strong>Affiliate Disclosure:</strong> This article contains affiliate links. If you purchase through our links, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We only recommend tools we'd genuinely suggest to a business owner.</p>

      <h2>The Bottom Line</h2>
      <p>AI writing tools have moved beyond simple spell-checkers. In 2026, the best tools can generate blog posts, rewrite emails, adapt your tone for different audiences, and even suggest better ways to structure your arguments. This guide covers the tools worth paying for.</p>

      <table class="w-full border-collapse my-8 bg-white shadow-sm rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-blue-600 text-white">
            <th class="p-4 text-left">Category</th>
            <th class="p-4 text-left">Best Tool</th>
            <th class="p-4 text-left">Starting Price</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">Grammar & style</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">Grammarly Premium</td><td class="p-4">~£10/month</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">Long-form content</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">Jasper AI</td><td class="p-4">~£30/month</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">AI assistant</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">ChatGPT Plus</td><td class="p-4">~£16/month</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">SEO content</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">Surfer SEO</td><td class="p-4">~£50/month</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">Marketing copy</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">Copy.ai</td><td class="p-4">~£30/month</td></tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="p-4">Readability</td><td class="p-4 font-semibold">Hemingway Editor</td><td class="p-4">£15 one-time</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>1. Grammarly Premium</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: Grammar, tone, and clarity</strong></p>
      <p>Grammarly remains the gold standard for catching errors and improving readability. The Premium version adds vocabulary suggestions, tone adjustments, and full-sentence rewrites.</p>
      <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Free plan available. Premium from ~£10/month.</p>

      <h2>2. Jasper AI</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: Long-form blog content and marketing copy</strong></p>
      <p>Jasper is purpose-built for content creators who need to produce articles, landing pages, and ad copy at scale.</p>
      <p><strong>Affiliate Programme:</strong> Up to 30% recurring commission for 12 months.</p>

      <h2>3. ChatGPT Plus</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: General writing assistance and brainstorming</strong></p>
      <p>While not specifically a writing tool, ChatGPT Plus is remarkably versatile for drafting emails, rewriting content, and brainstorming ideas.</p>

      <h2>4. Surfer SEO</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: SEO-optimised content</strong></p>
      <p>Surfer analyses the top-ranking pages for your target keyword and tells you exactly what to include: word count, headings, keywords, and content structure.</p>

      <h2>5. Copy.ai</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: Marketing copy and social media</strong></p>
      <p>Copy.ai specialises in short-form marketing content: ad copy, social media captions, product descriptions, and email subject lines.</p>

      <h2>6. Hemingway Editor</h2>
      <p><strong>Best for: Readability and simplicity</strong></p>
      <p>Hemingway highlights complex sentences, passive voice, and unnecessary adverbs. One-time purchase, no subscription.</p>

      <h2>Which Tool Should You Choose?</h2>
      <p><strong>Start with:</strong> Grammarly Premium for everyday writing improvement.</p>
      <p><strong>Add when creating content:</strong> Jasper AI if you publish regular blog posts.</p>
      <p><strong>For SEO content:</strong> Surfer SEO if organic search traffic matters.</p>

      <p><em>Last updated: April 2026. Pricing subject to change. Some links are affiliate links.</em></p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
